{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\udddb\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>Vampire Cat - Playable demo</strong> \ud83d\udc3e</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Test a free first version of Vampire Cat, a 2D roguelike mixed with idle game mechanics where you capture and upgrade vampire cats.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What this demo contains :</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A vampire creature from the start</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 attacks to choose from</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The \u201cSpin\u201d and attack zone system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Automatic capture of stricken enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Up to 6 creatures to collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Improved HP and damage up to level 10</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First levels of progressive difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Creature management interface and statistics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo does not represent the final content of the game. It allows you to try out the basic mechanics and get a first idea of the gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd14 <strong>We welcome your feedback!</strong><br>\ud83c\udfaf Don't forget to add the game to your wishlist to keep track of the project's progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672910/extras/GIF01.gif?t=1745495677\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3672910?t=1745495677","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3672910?t=1745495677","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672910/3b03fe23c1c8aa2fcfa5de9da8f419a89dac7202/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745495677","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite